; Coverage for value.cc: rounded() on a multi-commodity balance runs
; report_t::fn_rounded -> value_t::rounded -> the BALANCE case of
; value_t::in_place_round -> balance_t::in_place_round, which applies
; amount_t::in_place_round (display-only rounding) to each component.

2024/01/01 Test
    Expenses:Food    $100.00
    Expenses:Food    10.00 EUR
    Assets:Cash

test bal Expenses --balance-format "%(rounded(total / 3))\n===\n"
$33.33
3.33 EUR
===
end test
